      "value": "This should've already been fixed recently in [VRChat 2026.3.2 (OPEN BETA)](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202632-open-beta) - August 25, `Build 1898`:\n\n> Fixed an issue where the content cache would sometimes not be cleared after pressing Clear Content Cache and then restarting VRChat.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/clearing-cache-issue\n\n> I have attached my latest output logs detailing this failure for further diagnostic review.\n\nThe logs are missing.",
